/*
 * OperatorExpander — expands operator expressions into YIL values.
 *
 * The OperatorExpander lowers all operator constructs into concrete YILValue
 * and YILInstr nodes. It handles:
 *
 *   - affectations(=),
 *   - casts,
 *   - unary operators,
 *   - binary operators(including logical && and ||),
 *   - class-type comparisons(is / !is),
 *   - field access,
 *   - slice/array access,
 *   - map operators,
 *   - call operators.
 *
 * It ensures correct evaluation order, short-circuit semantics, unique-value
 * registration, and correct l-value/r-value handling.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::lint::expander::value::operator
 * @File: ymirc/lint/expander/value/operator.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-06-23
